<title>POLAND: BYTOM NOV NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.1 MLN LOSS.</title>
<headline>BYTOM NOV NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.1 MLN LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.14 vs   0.15 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.19 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.23 vs   0.52</p>
<p> Sales		    5.92 vs   6.55</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.30 vs   2.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.83 vs   4.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.97 vs   7.82</p>
<p> Sales		   78.17 vs  70.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
